# Local-only overrides (configuration.local.md, notes.local, settings.local.json, ...)
# Two patterns instead of `*.local*`, which would also catch e.g. `strings.localization.md`
# Note: `local` is a reserved project name — `*.<project-name>.md` overlays are tracked,
# but `*.local.*` never is.
*.local
*.local.*

# Local-only directories: anything inside a local/ dir, at any depth
local/
